\begin_layout Paragraph
Choosing the numerical parameters.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\begin_inset Flex Code
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
delta
\end_layout

\end_inset

 must resolve the narrowest feature of the spectral function,
 whose width is set by 
\begin_inset Formula $\Gamma$
\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset Formula $U$
\end_inset

.
 Halve it and compare.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\begin_inset Flex Code
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
dw
\end_layout

\end_inset

,
 
\begin_inset Flex Code
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
up
\end_layout

\end_inset

 must contain the broadened spectrum;
 check that 
\begin_inset Formula $W_{a}\approx1$
\end_inset

.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Runtime and memory grow as 
\begin_inset Formula $N_{\omega}\propto(\text{bandwidth}+\code{dw}+\code{up})/\delta$
\end_inset

.
 The Broyden history needs 
\begin_inset Formula $2\,\code{nhist}\cdot n$
\end_inset

 doubles,
 with 
\begin_inset Formula $n\approx3N_{\text{orb}}^{2}N_{\omega}$
\end_inset

.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
If a voltage does not converge,
 lower 
\begin_inset Flex Code
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
alpha_mix
\end_layout

\end_inset

 (e.g.
\begin_inset space \space{}
\end_inset

0.2) or raise 
\begin_inset Flex Code
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
maxscf
\end_layout

\end_inset

;
 large 
\begin_inset Formula $U/|t|$
\end_inset

 needs smaller 
\begin_inset Formula $\alpha$
\end_inset

.
 
\end_layout

