\begin_layout Standard
The restructured code reproduces the previous version (
\begin_inset Flex Code
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
SCF_stype
\end_layout

\end_inset

) to better than 
\begin_inset Formula $3\times10^{-8}$
\end_inset

 in all currents,
 populations and 
\begin_inset Formula $\langle S_{z}\rangle$
\end_inset

 for orders 0–2 (October 2026).
 Before the clean-up,
 according to its commit history,
 the code agreed with the spinless code and with earlier independent implementations,
 gave 
\begin_inset Formula $J=0$
\end_inset

 at 
\begin_inset Formula $V=0$
\end_inset

,
 and satisfied 
\begin_inset Formula $\Gg=\Gl+\Gr-\Ga$
\end_inset

 with interactions.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Section
Known limitations
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Perturbation theory in 
\begin_inset Formula $U$
\end_inset

 up to second order;
 large 
\begin_inset Formula $U/|t|$
\end_inset

 may not converge or may converge to the unphysical solutions that the sanity checks reject.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Wide-band leads coupled to the two end sites only;
 the bias is applied to the left lead.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
The energy grid is uniform;
 resolving sharp resonances needs a small 
\begin_inset Flex Code
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
delta
\end_layout

\end_inset

 everywhere.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Voltages are swept upwards only (
\begin_inset Flex Code
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
delv
\end_layout

\end_inset

 
\begin_inset Formula $>0$
\end_inset

).
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\begin_inset Flex Code
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
build_hamiltonian_from_xyz
\end_layout

\end_inset

 keeps the chain connectivity (bonds 
\begin_inset Formula $i$
\end_inset

–
\begin_inset Formula $i{+}1$
\end_inset

,
